  "body": "Fast. Play only during your turn.\nChose an enemy at your location. Resolve the following effects based on the amount of resources spent to play this card:\n<bul> If X is 2 or more: Until the end of the round, the next time that enemy attacks, cancel that attack.\n<bul> If X is 4 or more: Until the end of the round, investigators ignore the alert and retaliate keywords on that enemy.\n<bul> If X is 6 or more: Disengage from that enemy and move up to two locations away.",
